1. System is working properly - files ARE being generated (100+ files in output directory)
2. Recent commits show file generation: css_accessibility_analysis_report.md, test_brass_band_achievements.py
3. Activity tracker API returns 0 files despite files existing
4. Root cause: record_file_generated only called in main.py's _execute_agent_background method
5. This only tracks files detected by _scan_output_files AFTER agent execution, comparing before/after snapshots
