{"timestamp": "2026-01-14 23:23:21", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-4a6c805b-e672-430b-9df0-1c7ddda88ac3', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "It looks like the recovery pane might be running the jobs but I\'m not sure they\'re ever completing. I\'d like to move them back to the main agent hierarchy pane once recovery begins and treat them as any other job. Create a recovery agent that can be used to govern creating the executive director to manage the recovery of each job.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011fKexXMQj67VLYxzTt5iBh', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Recovery Agent System', 'description': 'Create a recovery agent that governs job recovery by spawning Executive Directors to manage recovered jobs, integrating them back into the main agent hierarchy pane.'}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JAKmNw81D5iV59fDSSmAHa', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011fKexXMQj67VLYxzTt5iBh', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "db6fc6c8", "message": "Created project: Recovery Agent System", "summary": {"project_id": "db6fc6c8", "project_name": "Recovery Agent System", "description": "Create a recovery agent that governs job recovery by spawning Executive Directors to manage recovered jobs, integrating them back into the main agent hierarchy pane.", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-14T23:23:00.819788", "updated_at": "2026-01-14T23:23:00.819788", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-14T23:23:00.819788", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Recovery Agent System\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JAKmNw81D5iV59fDSSmAHa', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "feature/brass-band-achievements", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "ogs/ensemble-backend.log.1", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.2", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": ["logs/ensemble-backend.log.3", "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/css_accessibility_analysis_report.md", "tests/runtime/agents/test_brass_band_achievements.py"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "a81afe1939da863370999b4c3bff0b885cdea04a", "message": "Executive Director: Complete UI readability fix project for Improve page", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "28 seconds ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "a81afe1939da863370999b4c3bff0b885cdea04a", "message": "Executive Director: Complete UI readability fix project for Improve page", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "28 seconds ago"}, {"hash": "dbb4e5cdf62e28d6aa04d1d80ad96ffa174e4b4c", "message": "Complete milestone 2: UI readability fix implementation and testing", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "51 seconds ago"}, {"hash": "91abbd5a22e7ab7748eb34750e92010366b3de1f", "message": "Complete milestone 1: UI readability analysis and architecture planning", "author": "Matt Billoc