{"timestamp": "2026-01-14 23:25:13", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-95d305b4-34f4-4f84-8586-012bacf4f07f', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Execute the planned fixes identified in the investigation for the Ensemble UI agent system, targeting the codebase under  \\n`/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output`.\\n\\nSpecifically:\\n- Implement missing activity tracking so that file generation, agent execution, and request counts are correctly recorded.\\n- Ensure `increment_request_counts` is invoked at the appropriate orchestration points.\\n- Extend file-generation reporting so files created by sub-agents and tool executions are consistently tracked and surfaced via the activity APIs.\\n- Validate fixes by re-running agent workflows and confirming that `/api/activity/files` and related UI views accurately reflect generated files and counts.\\n- Commit changes incrementally with clear messages and update any relevant documentation in the output directory to reflect the corrected behavior.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01M9y6YkQXWARDRxmBJTCsMF', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Ensemble UI Activity Tracking Fixes', 'description': 'Execute planned fixes for the Ensemble UI agent system to ensure activity tracking (file generation, agent execution, request counts) is correctly recorded and