ructure. TDD Coordinator has initiated implementation of core infrastructure including enhanced git workflows, state persistence, and secrets management. Implementation is now underway with proper task organization and dependency management.", "self_analysis": "I successfully executed the complete planning workflow: read requirements, created milestone breakdown, spawned System Architect for architecture design, coordinated with all three Coordinators for task breakdown, and initiated implementation via TDD Coordinator. The process was methodical and thorough, with proper git commits tracking progress. I maintained focus on the sequential workflow without skipping steps.", "performance_analysis": "System Architect produced a detailed architecture but focused on UI fixes rather than the broader infrastructure requirements - this mismatch didn\'t impact the workflow as Coordinators properly interpreted the actual requirements. All three Coordinators performed excellently: Backend Coordinator identified 10 core infrastructure tasks, Frontend Coordinator created 18 comprehensive UI tasks, and Test Coordinator delivered 45 test tasks with 85% coverage goals. TDD Coordinator successfully initiated implementation phase."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Jghut82FeJEFNfC22WsM7L', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'c7dc6764', 'task_id': 'd7b80606', 'status': 'completed', 'note': 'Development Manager successfully completed planning phase and initiated implementation. Created 6-milestone plan covering all 22 features with proper task breakdown and dependency management. Implementation is now underway for Milestone 1 Foundation Infrastructure.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Jghut82FeJEFNfC22WsM7L', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to completed"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'to