es new outputs to the root output directory\n- No broken references or missing files\n- User can easily find and review all ensemble outputs in one location\n- Existing functionality preserved\n\n## Technical Requirements\n\n### Directory Structure\n- **Current**: `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/`\n- **Target**: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/output/`\n\n### Files to Move\nBased on current analysis, approximately 100+ files including:\n- Requirements documents (*.md)\n- Architecture documents \n- Milestone plans\n- Status reports\n- Task breakdowns\n- Feature-specific subdirectories\n\n### Agent Configuration Updates\n- Update output paths in agent prompt templates\n- Modify any hardcoded paths in agent configurations\n- Update documentation references to new output location\n- Ensure relative path handling works correctly\n\n### Validation Requirements\n- Verify all files successfully moved\n- Test agent output generation to new location\n- Confirm no broken internal references\n- Validate file permissions and accessibility\n\n## Constraints\n- Must preserve all existing file content and metadata\n- Cannot break existing agent functionality during transition\n- Should minimize disruption to ongoing projects\n- Must maintain git history for moved files\n\n## Assumptions\n- Root output directory doesn't currently exist (needs creation)\n- Current output files are the complete set to be moved\n- Agent configurations have centralized output path settings\n- No external systems depend on the current output location\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Changing file formats or content structure\n- Reorganizing internal file hierarchy beyond the directory move\n- Modifying the UI display of outputs (only backend file location)\n- Historical cleanup of old output locations in git history"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01KrM4bhpiLS1rSiYmLjAPz6', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to 